  m_text: TrainAR originated from and was initially funded by this project of the German Federal Ministry of Education and Research (BMBF, grant 16DHB3021), which explored procedural augmented reality emergency trainings for academic midwifery education. TrainAR is the abstraction and generalization of the interaction concepts, feedback mechanisms and didactic ideas developed there.
